  "title": "Strengthening the Hybrid Engine Powering Autonomous Systems",
  "summary": "Autonomous technology is already out in public spaces, from self-driving cars to sidewalk delivery robots. What keeps these machines moving is a combination of artificial and human intelligence. Perception systems power routine navigation. Teleoperators step in the moment conditions become unpredictable. This partnership, known as human-AI complementarity, makes safety and scale possible. This white paper […]",
